%%begintext align
%% The two 1st Men and two 1st We. fall back, and meet,
%% and turn all single; the 1st Cu. lead down the Middle and
%% sett to their Partners, the 2d Cu. do the same :| The 1st
%% Cu. take Hands and 2d Cu. take Hands and draw their Partners
%% into each other's Place; the 1st Cu. lead thro the 2d
%% Cu. and come into the 2d Cu Place; the right and left
%% quite round, and turn their own Partners 'till the Tune
%% is done :|
%% [CCDM1]
%%endtext
